{{!
    @template mod_suddendeath/play

    One question in a Sudden Death run.

    Each answer is its own submit button, so answering costs one click and needs no
    JavaScript. Buttons are real buttons, so they are reachable and operable from the
    keyboard and announced correctly by a screen reader.

    The context carries no indication of which answer is correct.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * cmid number The course module id
    * questionid number The question being asked
    * questiontext string The question, already formatted
    * streak number The streak so far
    * targetstreak number The streak counting as 100 per cent
    * sesskey string The session key for the post
    * answers array The answer options
      * id number The answer id
      * text string The answer text, already formatted

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cmid": 42,
        "questionid": 77,
        "questiontext": "<p>Which organelle makes ATP?</p>",
        "streak": 3,
        "targetstreak": 15,
        "sesskey": "abc123",
        "answers": [
            {"id": 21, "text": "Nucleus"},
            {"id": 22, "text": "Mitochondrion"},
            {"id": 23, "text": "Ribosome"},
            {"id": 24, "text": "Golgi apparatus"}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="suddendeath-play">

    <p class="suddendeath-play__streak" role="status">
        {{#str}} streaksofar, mod_suddendeath, {{streak}} {{/str}}
    </p>

    <form method="post" action="{{{config.wwwroot}}}/mod/suddendeath/play.php" class="suddendeath-play__form">
        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{cmid}}">
        <input type="hidden" name="questionid" value="{{questionid}}">
        <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">

        <fieldset class="suddendeath-play__question">
            <legend class="suddendeath-play__questiontext">{{{questiontext}}}</legend>

            <div class="suddendeath-play__answers">
                {{#answers}}
                    <button type="submit" name="answerid" value="{{id}}"
                            class="btn btn-outline-primary suddendeath-play__answer">
                        {{text}}
                    </button>
                {{/answers}}
            </div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>

</div>
